# Copy to .env (never commit it). Read at build time by Vite.

# The relay (docs/backend.md#the-record, #live-relay). The live socket defaults to the production relay
# (lib/sync/live.ts) and the record to the same origin's /api (lib/sync/transport.ts). `npm run dev` uses the demo's
# generated rows unless VITE_RECORD_URL is set. Both emptied → the app shows "Not set up yet" (?demo still works).
# VITE_RECORD_URL=https://island-fund-relay-test.island-fund-relay.workers.dev/api
# VITE_LIVE_URL=wss://island-fund-relay-test.island-fund-relay.workers.dev/room

# Base path of the static site (GitHub Pages project site). CI sets it to /<repo name>.
# BASE_PATH=/fitness
